window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Home-sweet-home? Not at Pine Ridge trailer park…</b></p> <p>My name is Logan Greenwood, and I’d rather be anywhere else.</p> <p>When I decided to come home to help my mom out of a rough spot, I had no idea how bad it would be.</p> <p>But when a freak storm kicks up and I literally get sucked into another world, family drama is the least of my worries. I couldn’t get home if I wanted to.</p> <p>And in this world–full of drop-dead gorgeous elves, nymphs, and dryads–the last thing on my mind is going home.</p> <p>Only problem is, this perfect world is on the brink of war. As Drakkus, Lord of Chaos, and his minions descend upon my newfound paradise, one thing becomes clear: somebody has to stop this guy, and that somebody is me.</p> <p><i>This is fiction with the male audience in mind. That means you'll get heroic battles between good and evil, lots of beautiful and powerful women, and a badass MC who slays on the battlefield and between the sheets.</i></p>"; 
